('perro_comida_frecuencia_comidas', 'en', 'Why is it recommended to split a dog\'s daily food into 2 portions instead of one?', 'It helps digestion and can reduce the risk of bloat/GDV in large breeds', 'There\'s no real reason', 'Just so it eats more overall', 'So it gets less bored', 'A', 'Bloat/GDV is a serious emergency, more common in large breeds that eat fast in one sitting.');
